          "name": "memanto_remember",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:629ae75eb351a8a4725546a61cf9bebd86c1c070ca956a99428ed9752b6dba1b",
          "description": "Store a structured memory in Memanto for long-term persistence. Use this to save facts, observations, decisions, preferences, or any information that should be available to other agents or future sessions. Each memory has a type, title (max 100 chars), content (max 10000 chars), confidence score, and optional tags.",
